Stock Price Prediction Using LSTM

Objective
To develop a deep learning model using LSTM (Long Short-Term Memory) to forecast the next 15 days of a stock's adjusted closing price based on historical data and technical indicators.

Key Features

Accepts user input for stock symbol, date range, and timeframe

Fetches historical stock data using Yahoo Finance via the yfinance library

Computes and visualizes:

Adjusted Close Price

MACD (Moving Average Convergence Divergence)

RSI (Relative Strength Index)

Prepares sequences using the past 60 days of data to predict the next 15 days

Trains an LSTM-based model using Keras (TensorFlow backend)

Predicts future prices and compares them with actual values

Evaluated using R² Score, achieving a value of 0.8037

Tech Stack

Python

yfinance

pandas, numpy, matplotlib

ta (for technical indicators)

scikit-learn

tensorflow / keras

Visual Outputs

Graphs showing actual vs predicted adjusted close prices

Plots of MACD and RSI over the selected time range

How to Run the Project

Clone the repository

Install the dependencies using:
pip install -r requirements.txt











